flowchart TB
    START([Camera delivers a frame]) --> G1{Previous frame<br/>still processing?}
    G1 -->|Yes| SKIP1[/Discard frame/]
    SKIP1 --> END1([Return])

    G1 -->|No| G2{Less than<br/>150 ms since<br/>last frame?}
    G2 -->|Yes| SKIP2[/Discard frame/]
    SKIP2 --> END1

    G2 -->|No| LOCK[Set _isProcessing = true<br/>record timestamp]
    LOCK --> FMT{Frame format?}
    FMT -->|YUV420| YUV[Convert YUV to RGB<br/>using BT.601 coefficients]
    FMT -->|BGRA| BGRA[Relabel bytes as image]
    FMT -->|Other| NULLJ[/Return null/]
    NULLJ --> UNLOCK

    YUV --> JPEG[Encode JPEG quality 92]
    BGRA --> JPEG
    JPEG --> SEND[Send over MethodChannel<br/>lips/offline/face]
    SEND --> NATIVE[Native MediaPipe<br/>runs face detection]
    NATIVE --> FACE{Face found?}

    FACE -->|No| EMPTY[Build no-face result<br/>all values zero]
    FACE -->|Yes| EXTRACT[Extract 6 mouth blendshapes<br/>and 6 lip landmarks]
    EXTRACT --> BOX[Compute mouth bounding box]
    BOX --> PARSE[Parse reply into FaceLipsResult]
    EMPTY --> PARSE

    PARSE --> LIP[LipsingDetector.update<br/>adds isLipsing]
    LIP --> LET[LipLetterDetector.update<br/>adds letter + confidence]
    LET --> STORE[Store as session result]
    STORE --> REDRAW[onUpdate then setState<br/>screen redraws]
    REDRAW --> UNLOCK[finally:<br/>_isProcessing = false]
    UNLOCK --> END2([Ready for next frame])

    style UNLOCK fill:#fdf3e2,stroke:#8c5a00
    style G1 fill:#eef2fb,stroke:#3b3a8f
    style G2 fill:#eef2fb,stroke:#3b3a8f
